### Transaction Intelligence API — runnable examples
### VS Code "REST Client" or JetBrains HTTP Client. Run "login" first.

@base = http://localhost:3100/api

### Health (no auth)
GET {{base}}/health

### Login (seeded demo user)
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "amaka@ofada.test", "password": "Password123!" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Who am I
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Accounts (copy an id into @accountId below)
# @name accounts
GET {{base}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
@accountId = {{accounts.response.body.$[0].id}}

### Import one transaction (send twice: 201 then 200 duplicate)
POST {{base}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "externalReference": "DEMO-0001",
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "amount": "12999.75",
  "direction": "DEBIT",
  "description": "SLACK TECHNOLOGIES SUBSCRIPTION",
  "merchant": "Slack",
  "date": "2026-11-10"
}

### Batch import with partial failures and an Idempotency-Key (send twice: second is replayed)
POST {{base}}/transactions/batch
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-batch-0001

{
  "transactions": [
    { "externalReference": "DEMO-0002", "accountId": "{{accountId}}", "amount": "250000.00", "direction": "CREDIT", "description": "NIP TRF FROM CHOPLIFE RESTAURANTS LTD/INV-20999", "date": "2026-11-11" },
    { "externalReference": "DEMO-0003", "accountId": "{{accountId}}", "amount": 99.5, "direction": "DEBIT", "description": "JSON number amount is rejected", "date": "2026-11-11" },
    { "externalReference": "DEMO-0004", "accountId": "{{accountId}}", "amount": "45000.00", "direction": "DEBIT", "description": "TRF TO MAMA CHIOMA CATERING", "date": "2026-11-12" }
  ]
}

### List: newest first, 10 per page
GET {{base}}/transactions?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List: search + filters
GET {{base}}/transactions?q=paystack&direction=CREDIT&minAmount=1000000.00&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List: only transactions needing review
GET {{base}}/transactions?flagged=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Transaction detail (paste an id)
GET {{base}}/transactions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Correct a category (paste an id; expectedVersion from detail)
PATCH {{base}}/transactions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/category
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "category": "RENT", "note": "This is the shop rent", "expectedVersion": 1 }

### Open review flags
GET {{base}}/review/flags?status=OPEN&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Flag counts by type
GET {{base}}/review/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Resolve or dismiss a flag (paste an id)
PATCH {{base}}/review/flags/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "DISMISSED", "note": "Expected annual equipment purchase" }

### Dashboard for a period
GET {{base}}/dashboard?from=2026-08-01&to=2026-11-30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
